WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.246 --> 00:00:04.763
"Roar!" Rex said.

2
00:00:04.764 --> 00:00:08.999
"I'm king of the hill!"

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.911
The buddies were climbing a mountain.

4
00:00:16.912 --> 00:00:21.060
Rex's foot slipped.

5
00:00:21.061 --> 00:00:27.891
"Be careful, Rex!" Sara said.

6
00:00:27.892 --> 00:00:31.482
Sara's foot slipped.

7
00:00:31.483 --> 00:00:34.226
Small rocks rolled.

8
00:00:34.227 --> 00:00:38.547
"Be careful, Sara!" Rex said.

9
00:00:38.548 --> 00:00:44.856
Suddenly everyone heard a rumble.

10
00:00:44.857 --> 00:00:48.254
Tor gulped.

11
00:00:48.255 --> 00:00:52.497
"Look out!" Sid cried.

12
00:00:52.498 --> 00:00:55.751
"It's a rock slide!"

13
00:00:55.752 --> 00:00:59.081
Big rocks bounced and rolled.

14
00:00:59.082 --> 00:01:05.157
One rock rolled toward Tor.

15
00:01:05.158 --> 00:01:08.899
Tor flew out of its way.

16
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:17.180
Sara and Sid ran fast.

17
00:01:17.181 --> 00:01:26.560
They hid behind a big tree.

18
00:01:26.561 --> 00:01:31.761
Rex found a cave.

19
00:01:31.762 --> 00:01:35.560
"I'll hide in here!" he thought.

20
00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:40.573
Rex dived into the cave.

21
00:01:40.574 --> 00:01:43.032
"Whew!" Rex said.

22
00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:43.989
Boom!

23
00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:48.783
A big rock blocked the cave.

24
00:01:48.784 --> 00:01:51.656
"Uh-oh!" Rex said.

25
00:01:51.657 --> 00:01:53.901
He pushed.

26
00:01:53.902 --> 00:01:56.975
But the rock was too heavy.

27
00:01:56.976 --> 00:02:00.642
"This is bad!" Rex cried.

28
00:02:00.643 --> 00:02:08.196
"I'm trapped!"

